We will import the shirt block file made in the previous version.

740
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:19,000
It will prompt that the file will be added as a new block file.

741
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:22,000
The previously created part

742
00:44:22,000 --> 00:44:25,000
needs to be converted and registered again through the upload method.

743
00:44:25,000 --> 00:44:29,000
This process will be changed to an automatic conversion into a block in the future.

744
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:35,000
Next is to increase the option of setting the required folder as a default folder.

745
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:37,000
In version 7.3,

746
00:44:37,000 --> 00:44:40,000
when the enterprise user uses the new block file,

747
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:42,000
they will often use a network drive,

748
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:44,000
such as OneDrive and Google Drive,

749
00:44:44,000 --> 00:44:46,000
to share the folder.

750
00:44:46,000 --> 00:44:50,000
However, the new block file does not allow users to change the default folder settings,

751
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:53,000
so we have to copy and paste it every time,

752
00:44:53,000 --> 00:44:55,000
which makes it inconvenient to operate.

753
00:44:55,000 --> 00:44:57,000
With the update of Cloud 2024,

754
00:44:57,000 --> 00:45:02,000
we have added the option of setting the required folder as a default folder.

755
00:45:02,000 --> 00:45:04,000
On the Cloud 2024 interface,

756
00:45:04,000 --> 00:45:06,000
click on Settings on the main menu,

757
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:07,000
then on Settings,

758
00:45:07,000 --> 00:45:08,000
then on User Identification,

759
00:45:08,000 --> 00:45:09,000
then on Others,

760
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:11,000
then on Blockcharts,

761
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:13,000
and then on default folder.

762
00:45:13,000 --> 00:45:16,000
Click on the file folder icon on the right,

763
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:18,000
and then in the selected folder window,

764
00:45:18,000 --> 00:45:21,000
select the required folder as a default folder,

765
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:24,000
and then click on Close.

766
00:45:24,000 --> 00:45:28,000
Next, let's check if the default folder has been successfully set.

767
00:45:28,000 --> 00:45:29,000
Open the blockcharts.

768
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:32,000
When I want to add a new group in the blockcharts,

769
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:34,000
please click on the refresh button first,

770
00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:35,000
and then click on Add Group.

771
00:45:35,000 --> 00:45:37,000
In the open file window,

772
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:40,000
the default folder is displayed.

773
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:44,000
When we want to create a blockchart according to the current clothing style,

774
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:47,000
please click on the file on the main menu,

775
00:45:47,000 --> 00:45:49,000
and then on Style.

776
00:45:49,000 --> 00:45:52,000
The blockchart generator window will appear,

777
00:45:52,000 --> 00:45:57,000
and the default folder will be listed in the search section.

778
00:45:57,000 --> 00:45:59,000
Then click on the Add button.

779
00:45:59,000 --> 00:46:01,000
In the open file window,

780
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:04,000
the default folder is displayed.

781
00:46:04,000 --> 00:46:09,000
The above display indicates that we have successfully set the default folder.

782
00:46:09,000 --> 00:46:12,000
With the update of Cloud 2024,

783
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:16,000
we have added the option to set the data folder as the default folder.

784
00:46:16,000 --> 00:46:19,000
This will make it easier for us to create blockchart files,

785
00:46:19,000 --> 00:46:22,000
and share blockchart files internally.

786
00:46:22,000 --> 00:46:26,000
Next, I would like to talk about the new function update related to rendering,

787
00:46:26,000 --> 00:46:29,000
which is to be able to save the rotating animation with a transparent background.

788
00:46:29,000 --> 00:46:31,000
In the previous version,

789
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:33,000
due to the inability to select the transparency option,

790
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:38,000
the software was unable to render the JIF rotating images and animations with a transparent background.

791
00:46:38,000 --> 00:46:41,000
From the start of the Cloud 2024 version,

792
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:43,000
you can select the transparency option,

793
00:46:43,000 --> 00:46:48,000
and save the JIF rotating images and animations with a transparent background.

794
00:46:48,000 --> 00:46:52,000
Next, let's take a look at the specific operation process.

795
00:46:52,000 --> 00:46:55,000
In the interface of the new 2024 version,

796
00:46:55,000 --> 00:46:58,000
click on Render on the main menu.

797
00:46:58,000 --> 00:47:00,000
In the rendering window,

798
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:02,000
click on the image video attribute.

799
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:06,000
In the image video of the attribute editor,

800
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:09,000
select Rotate Image or Animation.

801
00:47:09,000 --> 00:47:11,000
Then, save the JIF.

802
00:47:11,000 --> 00:47:13,000
In the background column,

803
00:47:13,000 --> 00:47:15,000
find the transparency option.

804
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:17,000
As shown,

805
00:47:17,000 --> 00:47:22,000
the transparency can be selected after selecting Rotate Image or Animation.

806
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:25,000
It is no longer gray and unselectable.

807
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:27,000
After setting the attribute,

808
00:47:27,000 --> 00:47:28,000
click on Final Render.

809
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:31,000
Finally, a JIF rotating animation that can be rotated will be generated.

810
00:47:31,000 --> 00:47:34,000
Open the JIF file completed,

811
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:37,000
and check the final effect.

812
00:47:37,000 --> 00:47:43,000
This function allows us to save the JIF rotating animation with a transparent background.

813
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:48,000
It is convenient for us to display the rotating animation on different platforms.

814
00:47:52,000 --> 00:47:55,000
Finally, let's talk about the color update.

